rt your job as a night administrator at the mysterious Horizon Motel, where visitors from another world try to pass as ordinary people, and the rules have the highest priority \u2014 breaking them leads to\u2026 undesirable consequences.","steam_appid":3156680,"support_info":{"email":"outnordgames@gmail.com","url":"https://outnordgames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, Russian","type":"game","website":"https://outnordgames.com/"}